{"reviewId": "439940589_86zIlWzK7", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "全球铜矿的资本开支在2012-2013年达到顶峰（约260亿美元/年），随后逐年下降，2022年减少到一半，直到近几年因铜价格和需求走强才开始增加。从铜矿产量看，过去十年全球铜矿产量年均增长约2%，但增长量绝大部分不是来自新发现的超级大矿，而是建立在扩建老矿上。随着全球露天矿的枯竭，新投产的矿山开采成本更高难度也越大。虽当期供需铜库存仍过剩，可铜矿从勘探到投产平均10年以上，结合需求侧，印度近几年正在大搞基建和制造业，资源需求大，叠加AI带来的电力基建需求，和能源转型（风电，光伏，新能源车等）累积的供需缺口，未来铜价的上涨空间巨大。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "14962-14988", "abstract": "康波资源牛市是一个累积的结果，当期供需并不是核心原因", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "439940589_86zIlWzK7", "userVid": 439940589, "topics": [], "createTime": 1769879175, "userEditTime": 1769918631, "isPrivate": 0, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 439940589, "name": "飘", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0003-MN050ybswvrysqjBPvubIfb/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "吾生也有涯，而知也无涯", "medalInfo": {"id": "M1-0-90", "desc": "连续阅读", "title": "连续阅读", "levelIndex": 90}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 26, "likes": [{"userVid": 415928528, "name": "Ray", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/8S16IAgKqkwYHWeibx8RPqYOUaUiaXZAomyyW0kwXUoibJaXUqiaTVXpZthOQl2rUFL5RBTUlSWUUrk/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-100", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 3, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "这个案例比较好